Well...but you and your Pokémon
understand each other.{VAR BE01}
Isn't that right?

This happened to me once after
I crossed a bridge.{VAR BE01}
When I was at a loss, the person who
helped me was a total stranger...{VAR BE01}
After all, helping each other is
important in life.

When I go to the Entralink next time,
I'd like to register a Pass Power and{VAR BE00}
make everyone smile!

{VAR BE09 0002}People who visited the Entralink
hid items somewhere...{VAR BE00}
The Entralink is unique, isn't it?{VAR BE09 0000}

I want other people to like me...
There is a reward...{VAR BE01}
It's OK to help people with
such motivations.{VAR BE00}
Because helping is itself a great thing!

Living is using time given to you.
You cannot recall lost time.{VAR BE01}
Don't forget that...

Happiness is here today, gone tomorrow.{VAR BE01}
There is no everlasting happiness, so
don't be greedy.
